These five Wine 8.0 INF payloads are staged into both prebuilt Wine prefixes
at `C:\windows\inf`. The pinned `.update-timestamp` disables wineboot's
`wine.inf` `InfFiles` update step, so Plug and Play otherwise cannot match the
Wine HID and XInput function drivers.

Sources from Wine 8.0, matching the complete `InfFiles` section in `wine.inf`:
- `dlls/hidclass.sys/input.inf`
- `dlls/winebus.sys/winebus.inf`
- `dlls/winehid.sys/winehid.inf`
- `dlls/wineusb.sys/wineusb.inf`
- `dlls/winexinput.sys/winexinput.inf`

Wine project files are distributed under LGPL-2.1-or-later.
